resolution: Work completed and released in 2026.6.3. Release attribution set explicitly so pm-changelog --respect-item-release files the entry under 2026.6.3 instead of the pending release section.
expected_result: "A closed item whose changelog entry appears under the 2026.6.3 heading it actually shipped in, leaving the pending release notes untouched."
actual_result: "Item remained in_progress with no activity after its work shipped, so the delivery was absent from the changelog while still counting as open work in every fleet audit."
close_reason: "Retired as shipped: the unified presets list and apply commands, the kanban preset and registerItemType support, all present in src/catalog.ts and src/registry.ts today was completed and released in 2026.6.3, but the item was never closed and sat in progress ever since, inflating every fleet audit."
